#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:7
#: 58097a9eadc54ce69514390e0a4d71f2 58600bb1420a4fa899cb49e42d6e66a4
#: 7509e20bf2354df7a2d97d1068e6a1ee 8de8cbec911c4d79884b95016a61e38e
#: ea4047748389416a8bba4d4c143eab3d
msgid "Using a Vicon indoor positioning system"
msgstr "使用 Vicon 室内定位系统"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:9
#: 3abaa308fdb84daa8aa5166bc6c151fe 8aa604600c724a3c89f20d244eb47288
#: a656b159bc144559888da9d708ab9e3c bba2d3b759b8460b8528120e27521dc2
#: cffeb78241b446ee865027cbe5d6d9d4
msgid ""
"Robotics labs commonly have an indoor flying facility using a Vicon indoor "
"positioning system. These systems use infra-red cameras to give a high rate "
"(200Hz) position and attitude via a network connection. ArduPilot can use "
"this positioning information for precise indoor flight."
msgstr ""
"机器人实验室通常有使用 Vicon "
"室内定位系统的室内飞行设施。这些系统使用红外摄像机通过网络连接以高速率（200Hz）提供位置和姿态。ArduPilot "
"可以使用这些定位信息进行精确的室内飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:19
#: 5aa14f9834c243239474273163c6dfbd 94a8a17da42346b2b0b6d23e029746a8
#: 97eaf4ab497a4b148c1c95aa01a934cd b9140fe3283b4bf89262e86ee6244ed0
#: d3b09430c0d74542ad1cd92acca15731
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:21
#: 364a6a2347eb47fa8091ef8f68eb0eff 7578fbfc04ee4e6db090cd560d5ace41
#: 7cb03415aeb74766b2c0a6dfd5889b80 919050a2f82c462dbef0c23e6ea9e083
#: df75990b436d442da3189ad126a60636
msgid ""
"The Vicon system comes with a SDK that provides APIs for accessing the Vicon"
" positioning data. To use the Vicon data with ArduPilot you need a tool "
"which can use this API and map it onto MAVLink packets to send to ArduPilot."
msgstr ""
"Vicon 系统附带一个 SDK，提供访问 Vicon 定位数据的 API。要将 Vicon 数据与 ArduPilot 配合使用，您需要一个能使用此 "
"API 并将其映射到 MAVLink 数据包发送给 ArduPilot 的工具。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:26
#: 4a90e33e43f8428a83d7f15308045f0a 59b661d7acff4f42894918b0414882a6
#: 610e046379524798bf90556c51adf62a a63579cb409a4883b6c15469088907d2
#: ec22731aaafc429f8b0825adb161cbe7
msgid "There are two types of MAVLink packets that can be used:"
msgstr "可以使用两种类型的 MAVLink 数据包："

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:28
#: 0415d00305e14c32a64801bcaff9190f 6c31013af4814ac6bf9a79bfd28fde1b
#: 9df1a986b48c4716ae19031b3ee7e93e cd6bb2d4a0824dfdbc526337d83f04af
#: ee62e2c66eca4634aa65556885f57747
msgid ""
"the GLOBAL_VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE packet, which provides position (NED) "
"and attitude (euler angles)."
msgstr "GLOBAL_VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE 数据包，提供位置（NED）和姿态（欧拉角）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:31
#: 4233f38e747b4821b3799ba7b2d1435e 802e960afa9249b2ba37b2cccbcec491
#: ab2924d5662543de94903b563ad93cca be5ea714307e40e4979e88332e50664d
#: bea5e28fe8394456999e80acf0a0a315
msgid ""
"the GPS_INPUT packet which provides position as latitude/longitude, "
"altitude, velocity (3D) and yaw data."
msgstr "GPS_INPUT 数据包，提供纬度/经度位置、高度、速度（3D）和偏航数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:34
#: 0d9960f0355a4fb3b885ca7014f59cb3 266a0ad923d74ecf9bcc49f1e066f0cf
#: 9e4225e877b842dba966e0771a45edb4 c657c56fd82346989468779ee705e173
#: f3a805e2a3ad44dfb8c349845a08ca61
msgid ""
"Right now the best approach is to use GPS_INPUT with the GPS yaw extension "
"as the velocity data provided by the GPS packet is more valuable for good "
"positioning than the attitude information in the "
"GLOBAL_VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE packet. In the future we will support a "
"combined VISION MAVLink message which will provide position, velocity and "
"attitude in one packet."
msgstr ""
"目前最佳方式是使用带 GPS 偏航扩展的 GPS_INPUT，因为 GPS 数据包提供的速度数据比 "
"GLOBAL_VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE 数据包中的姿态信息对良好定位更有价值。未来我们将支持一种组合的 VISION "
"MAVLink 消息，将在一个数据包中提供位置、速度和姿态。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:42
#: 538267413e934be79428758b64cd11cf 5c366a7b8542444ca3f2320fd225c9e6
#: 956579aba36f450f9fa45598d3f40583 a30bd45145b24000aa429ed7bd8249d6
#: c73cf83817bc4e38a09c6d71eae2749f
msgid "Hardware Setup"
msgstr "硬件设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:44
#: 00aba1515eb34c018ee5aa1e6944d5bd
msgid ""
"You will need a low-latency network link from your GCS computer to the "
"copter, and from the GCS to your Vicon server. The recommened method is to "
"use ethernet to the Vicon server and use a ESP8266 WiFi link running "
"`mavest8266 <common-esp8266-telemetry>`_ on the copter."
msgstr ""
"您需要从 GCS 电脑到飞机以及从 GCS 到 Vicon 服务器的低延迟网络链接。推荐方法是使用以太网连接到 Vicon 服务器，并在飞机上使用运行 "
"`mavest8266 <common-esp8266-telemetry>`_ 的 ESP8266 WiFi 链路。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:50
#: 1e7a7a1fa657490b960a0681c91f58e3 200a294ab686498291c2e3d57a413dfb
#: b79240c39f2b4756bd73cd3023642eb4 c4855ffc8ce840f7a0856959e2ba0d22
#: de6a98bc1a4c4d5499d7286b584e5931
msgid "Vicon System Setup"
msgstr "Vicon 系统设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:52
#: 036d59f23ea747488c58efa89ecd64c5 601d7867aebe4405b0e2edbf94ba7ac1
#: 78db131c36c5460aa3a9257e23765f07 c4b74395d2d747ae82bc853fafd738ad
#: ea5c544935394425a156fe7de2ed5b08
msgid ""
"The Vicon system should be correctly calibrated. The origin should be set "
"using the calibration wand. In the Vicon Tracker software, the Z-axis (shown"
" in blue) of the Vicon system world frame should point up. We will call the "
"X-axis (red) as North, and the Y-axis (green) as West."
msgstr ""
"Vicon 系统应正确校准。应使用校准杆设置原点。在 Vicon Tracker 软件中，Vicon 系统世界坐标系的 Z 轴（蓝色）应指向上方。我们将"
" X 轴（红色）称为北，Y 轴（绿色）称为西。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:53
#: 37bf89d8221348f88a2c5cd136f28410 536b1fa7ec0047ab9e9d8bc925d6cfbb
#: 64e6b1e30a0948f1941d2503ee1e537f da1342d90bfc41e9971ceddeb65cf160
#: fad71ce332b049eb840af37b8a9dd08a
msgid ""
"The UAV should have a minimum of 4 reflective markers to ensure an accurate "
"fix. Any reflective surfaces on the UAV should be covered with masking tape "
"to avoid spurious detections."
msgstr "无人机应至少有 4 个反光标记以确保精确定位。无人机上的任何反光表面都应用遮蔽胶带覆盖以避免误检。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:54
#: 1853222b13db45aeadfe68df67e87cbe 8569177508704238a8ea215d43d52cdd
#: 9aefc57655084fa5ab9efc711fb59561 c9cd17ce178c4f1bad4f443335cfe10a
#: e1f1d8a36288457eb8b1d088ecb0c035
msgid ""
"Place the UAV in the Vicon space so that the forward direction of the "
"autopilot is facing 'North'. (Figure 1)"
msgstr "将无人机放置在 Vicon 空间中，使飞控的前进方向朝向「北」。（图 1）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:55
#: 27bb8fd1a1024403a700e9fd3dc8af12 358395ddec8a4d30ba5367125237c8c4
#: 49261d96158d4cf0b2efa35c46208458 9441dea6ff4d461186ac85a0ee009b25
#: aea95312d6074a5e8866c17d5625c60c
msgid ""
"In the Vicon Tracker, select all of the markers and create a new object for "
"the UAV. The coordinate frame of the UAV should then be aligned with the "
"Vicon world frame, so that X is forward, Y is Left and Z is up. (Figure 2)"
msgstr ""
"在 Vicon Tracker 中，选择所有标记并为无人机创建新对象。然后应将无人机的坐标系与 Vicon 世界坐标系对齐，使 X 朝前、Y 朝左、Z "
"朝上。（图 2）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:60
#: 114782f1e3234a969613edde84cc1526 4c1848e97d7d45edbc50226f2318036d
#: a220ee30c9e8416e852d0f736616648f c346925ab09b40edb9434bbf5482b7a7
#: d2eb9b916c9f4da1baa7b73c2b88ba19
msgid ""
"Figure 1: Example of how UAV should be positioned when creating the Vicon "
"Object. The forward direction is aligned with the X-axis."
msgstr "图 1：创建 Vicon 对象时无人机的定位示例。前进方向与 X 轴对齐。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:65
#: 17732b533b684e36a4898fd2031abb55 7a91ea0e8577413397d18729ae393bd9
#: 82ad2f5d81cf4dc18073c9d91dd5b50b bc7e39afd3584f1b940d86d1cebb1cb3
#: cb32bf4a31cb45b59ff8fd13958821b9
msgid ""
"Figure 2: Screenshot from Vicon Tracker software, showing world coordinate "
"frame (bottom left) aligned with UAV coordinate frame. The origin of the "
"object frame should be approximately where the autopilot is located."
msgstr "图 2：Vicon Tracker 软件截图，显示与无人机坐标系对齐的世界坐标系（左下角）。对象坐标系的原点应大致在飞控所在位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:70
#: 531fcb1f78f64759aedf0f50dcf3f48d 660d3ac880a14ba3bc3ca87e991cc8db
#: a8683cd94f5a4b15b4f814ae8ed7ca52 aced5cd404564e8f8b835993a9e04911
#: fd7b44e73c954f18be31fb76ed379317
msgid ""
"These coordinate frame conventions apply to MAVProxy version 1.8.36 and "
"above. Ensure you are using an up-to-date version."
msgstr "这些坐标系约定适用于 MAVProxy 1.8.36 及以上版本。请确保使用最新版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:73
#: 23e928081b354b96a160af5195284e64 4b0f4faa62fe44b6bacd79e4447d0989
#: 85eca659bd004229963257ef865bad60 90e9d73569d0491c92f9bd059e056312
#: a133b0f2b02c40f9b0480e5179b616c0
msgid "Software Setup"
msgstr "软件设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:75
#: 0f9c8d45587746878e207e1adda77684 5c3242473fe54aa1a9dcff8824b7cf15
#: 83f018b5ab7241b1924390bd760d43b3 e27f8a46093b43dd832f6198d1b2b471
#: f5a73cbcdb0b4e29b6cc3b493cd64503
msgid ""
"You will need a recent version of ArduPilot on your copter. As of September "
"2019 it is recommended that you use ArduPilot master. The recent version is "
"needed to give support for yaw data in the GPS_INPUT MAVLink message."
msgstr ""
"您的飞机需要安装最新版本的 ArduPilot。截至 2019 年 9 月，建议使用 ArduPilot master 版本。需要最新版本以支持 "
"GPS_INPUT MAVLink 消息中的偏航数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:80
#: 186985c3fd124b14b9a459c2e6ac3394 956692c79b2b467d98777f2e5044d52c
#: bc81e2e09b3749a9a9283a38542ea3ab be216056590647098baf4f3fc19cf39b
#: bf5e06aba55d44afacfb6e935480cb07
msgid ""
"The setup described below uses the vicon module in MAVProxy to feed the "
"Vicon data to your vehicle over MAVLink."
msgstr "以下描述的设置使用 MAVProxy 中的 vicon 模块通过 MAVLink 将 Vicon 数据传送到您的飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:84
