"Next you should put the IP address of your vicon server in your /etc/hosts "
"file, so that you can do \"ping vicon\". The name 'vicon' is used as the "
"default hostname in the MAVProxy vicon module."
msgstr ""
"接下来，应将 Vicon 服务器的 IP 地址添加到 /etc/hosts 文件中，以便执行「ping vicon」。名称「vicon」是 "
"MAVProxy vicon 模块中的默认主机名。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:132
