#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:171
#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:173
#: 139a95be669d468fad125f73b5c25c1d 43f6d8279bff494c8a7f764f872ec3dd
