#: 8d09c1cdc3514e44b66a53b817d09a82 95459bb32b9a4682b3f33f40df99b07a
msgid ""
"For a first test flight :ref:`Stabilize mode <stabilize-mode>` or :ref:`Alt "
"Hold mode <altholdmode>` mode is recommended. Then get the flight log from "
"the microSD card and check that the EKF3 innovations are low. The position, "
"velocity and yaw normalised innovations should all be low (below 0.1)."
msgstr ""
"首次试飞建议使用 :ref:`Stabilize 模式 <stabilize-mode>` 或 :ref:`Alt Hold 模式 "
"<altholdmode>`。然后从 microSD 卡获取飞行日志，检查 EKF3 "
"新息（innovation）是否较低。位置、速度和偏航的归一化新息都应较低（低于 0.1）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:211
#: 1b1d475b177f4843a38cb7d651fd5b53 79c7c9922e9d4a26a42ef5ed5a6a0859
#: 9f51bd47bcca410386d533026cbd3c6e cb555f60958949399709f005ba39903b
msgid ""
"Once you have confirmed low innovations you can try a flight in :ref:`Loiter"
" mode <loiter-mode>` mode."
msgstr "确认新息较低后，可以尝试在 :ref:`Loiter 模式 <loiter-mode>` 下飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-vicon-for-nongps-navigation.rst:217
#: 81627d2bb5384f47a12707ed3aab3aef ae4d3000b29e46c1902fe183b93d74ac
#: b180ccdf68e0456fb77a6c600f637a7f ba72bfb11c6e4a1a86f78620b1904409
msgid ""
"If you have significant vibration then you will likely want to de-weight the"
" accelerometers and instead tell the EKF to use the vicon data more. Try "
"setting :ref:`EK3_ACC_P_NSE <EK3_ACC_P_NSE>` to 2.0 to de-weight the "
"accelerometer data. You may find this helps with position and height hold."
msgstr ""
"如果震动明显，你可能需要降低加速度计的权重，转而让 EKF 更多地使用 Vicon 数据。可尝试将 :ref:`EK3_ACC_P_NSE "
"<EK3_ACC_P_NSE>` 设为 2.0 以降低加速度计数据的权重。这可能有助于位置和高度保持。"

